OL,3,GNEWSAScrapstore saved from closure by
OL,4,Agrant funds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity which collects donated scrap
OL,7,Fmaterials to be reused for art projects
OL,8,Fhas been saved from closure after it
OL,9,Fsecured grant funding.
OL,11,FScrapstore North Somerset, which is
OL,12,Fbased in Gazelle Road,
OL,13,FWeston-super-Mare, sells everything
OL,14,Ffrom strips of ripstop nylon to
OL,15,Fsequinned trousers and stick-on
OL,16,Feyebrows - all in the name of creative
OL,17,Freuse.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
