OL,3,GNEWSAScrapstore saved from closure by
OL,4,Agrant funds
OL,5,
OL,6,FStore manager Laura Jones said the
OL,7,F"amazing" and "really appreciated"
OL,8,Ffunding from the Quartet Community
OL,9,FFoundation and local councils meant
OL,10,Fthey would be able to remain open.
OL,12,FThe charity had announced in June that
OL,13,Fit was facing closure due to financial
OL,14,Fdifficulties.
